{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 756150,
  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44115914",
      "title": "Building a Custom Structural Directive",
      "lectureOrder": 160,
      "videoOrder": 152,
      "sourceHash": "47e31b6a76ebd5b70dc23494bfbf191ec9f4018ba062c5b3839c478d7f736319",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.69,
          "end": 3.45,
          "en": "So how can we now turn this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.45,
          "end": 5.46,
          "en": "into a structural directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.46,
          "end": 7.201,
          "en": "and change the DOM structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.201,
          "end": 10.92,
          "en": "depending on this auth status here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.92,
          "end": 13.62,
          "en": "Well first, we need to go to the place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.62,
          "end": 15.483,
          "en": "where we use the directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.41,
          "end": 18.45,
          "en": "And there as a first step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.45,
          "end": 20.673,
          "en": "we need to change the markup a little bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.6,
          "end": 24.72,
          "en": "Before we start adding an asterisk here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.72,
          "end": 27.75,
          "en": "I'll use this directive in a slightly other way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.75,
          "end": 29.67,
          "en": "on a different element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.67,
          "end": 33.36,
          "en": "I'll add the ng-template element, opening and closing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.36,
          "end": 36.24,
          "en": "And put my paragraph between those tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.24,
          "end": 39.933,
          "en": "and put this directive here onto ng-template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.49,
          "end": 46.2,
          "en": "Now, ng-template is a special element provided by Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.2,
          "end": 49.35,
          "en": "and its job is that you can use it in one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.35,
          "end": 51.714,
          "en": "of your component templates",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.714,
          "end": 54.54,
          "en": "to wrap some content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.54,
          "end": 56.76,
          "en": "In this case, this paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.76,
          "end": 61.76,
          "en": "which should not be shown on the screen initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.77,
          "end": 63.99,
          "en": "So whatever you put inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.99,
          "end": 68.31,
          "en": "of an ng-template will not be rendered on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.31,
          "end": 71.4,
          "en": "Instead, the idea behind ng-template is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.4,
          "end": 75.53999999999999,
          "en": "that you can define some content like this paragraph here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.53999999999999,
          "end": 79.08,
          "en": "that can eventually be rendered onto the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.08,
          "end": 82.56,
          "en": "So where you can control when exactly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.56,
          "end": 84.6,
          "en": "it should show up on the screen instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.6,
          "end": 86.94,
          "en": "of always showing it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.94,
          "end": 89.22,
          "en": "That's the idea behind ng-template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.22,
          "end": 93.36,
          "en": "It allows you to prepare some markup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.36,
          "end": 97.77000000000001,
          "en": "that should eventually be shown and you can control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.77000000000001,
          "end": 99.69,
          "en": "and we will soon control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.69,
          "end": 103.25999999999999,
          "en": "when exactly this wrapped markup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.25999999999999,
          "end": 106.89,
          "en": "this paragraph here should be shown.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.89,
          "end": 111.57,
          "en": "And structural directives always need such a template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.57,
          "end": 115.28999999999999,
          "en": "though this template can be added automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.28999999999999,
          "end": 117.81,
          "en": "behind the scenes if you use this asterisk.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.81,
          "end": 120.159,
          "en": "But we'll do this in a second step as a first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.159,
          "end": 121.658,
          "en": "We'll use it like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 121.658,
          "end": 125.52,
          "en": "because you can always use structural directives,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.52,
          "end": 129.33,
          "en": "including the built-in ngIf directive like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.33,
          "end": 133.383,
          "en": "on an ng-template element without the asterisk.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 134.58,
          "end": 137.82,
          "en": "This asterisk is just syntactic sugar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.82,
          "end": 141.36,
          "en": "for automatically adding this ng-template element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.36,
          "end": 142.53,
          "en": "behind the scenes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.53,
          "end": 144.885,
          "en": "But here I'll explicitly add it myself",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 144.885,
          "end": 147.42000000000002,
          "en": "and then just add this directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 147.42000000000002,
          "end": 150.003,
          "en": "as an attribute onto ng-template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.11,
          "end": 154.503,
          "en": "But that's important, onto ng-template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 155.707,
          "end": 158.94299999999998,
          "en": "not onto the element that should be rendered conditionally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.96,
          "end": 163.44,
          "en": "So we don't add it like an attribute directive onto the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 163.44,
          "end": 165.45,
          "en": "element that should be changed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.45,
          "end": 170.13,
          "en": "but instead onto a template that contains the content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 170.13,
          "end": 173.703,
          "en": "that might eventually end up in the DOM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 175.131,
          "end": 176.987,
          "en": "So that's the first important step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.987,
          "end": 181.987,
          "en": "The second step is then back in the auth directive class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 182.31,
          "end": 187.182,
          "en": "There, we now need to inject two additional things either",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 187.182,
          "end": 189.03,
          "en": "through the constructor",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 189.03,
          "end": 191.52,
          "en": "or with help of the inject function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 191.52,
          "end": 193.65,
          "en": "which is what I'll use here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 193.65,
          "end": 198.058,
          "en": "And the first thing we need to inject here is a reference to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 198.058,
          "end": 201.93,
          "en": "that template on which this directive was added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 201.93,
          "end": 205.14,
          "en": "So here I'll add a property called templateref,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 205.14,
          "end": 207.54,
          "en": "though the name doesn't matter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 207.54,
          "end": 211.2,
          "en": "and inject a value of type templateref.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 211.2,
          "end": 212.57999999999998,
          "en": "And this does matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 212.57999999999998,
          "end": 214.473,
          "en": "This must be templateref,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 216,
          "end": 219.633,
          "en": "and that is a type that must be imported from Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 222.06,
          "end": 225.72,
          "en": "Now when injecting a templateref, you tell Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 225.72,
          "end": 229.92000000000002,
          "en": "that this directive will be used on an ng-template element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 229.92000000000002,
          "end": 233.28,
          "en": "and that you wanna get hold of that template and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 233.28,
          "end": 236.76,
          "en": "therefore implicitly also of the content inside of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 236.76,
          "end": 240.21,
          "en": "that template, which by the way doesn't have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 240.21,
          "end": 241.83,
          "en": "to be a single element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 241.83,
          "end": 245.853,
          "en": "This could be any markup of any structure and complexity.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 247.29,
          "end": 249.84,
          "en": "So you can get hold of that template by injecting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 249.84,
          "end": 251.97,
          "en": "that templateref.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 251.97,
          "end": 253.83,
          "en": "And that's a super important step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 253.83,
          "end": 256.023,
          "en": "when building a structural directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 257.46,
          "end": 261.09,
          "en": "The last important step you need to go through is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 261.09,
          "end": 265.503,
          "en": "that you also must inject a so-called view container ref,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 267.876,
          "end": 268.98,
          "en": "also with inject or the constructor,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 268.98,
          "end": 272.67,
          "en": "and by injecting the view container ref type",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 272.67,
          "end": 275.34000000000003,
          "en": "or class to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 275.34000000000003,
          "end": 279.003,
          "en": "which also is imported from @Angular/core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 281.61,
          "end": 283.413,
          "en": "So that's all injected here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 285,
          "end": 289.68,
          "en": "This view container ref in the end is a reference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 289.68,
          "end": 294.39300000000003,
          "en": "to the place in the DOM where this template is being used.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 295.56,
          "end": 299.19,
          "en": "So the templateref in the end gives you access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 299.19,
          "end": 303.09,
          "en": "to the content of the template you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 303.09,
          "end": 306.48,
          "en": "The view container ref gives you access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 306.48,
          "end": 310.62,
          "en": "to the place in the DOM where this directive is being used.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 310.62,
          "end": 314.553,
          "en": "So where this template is being used, therefore in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 315.78,
          "end": 319.17,
          "en": "And you need both pieces of information to tell Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 319.17,
          "end": 321.33,
          "en": "where to render what.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 321.33,
          "end": 323.52,
          "en": "And that's what we'll do now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 323.52,
          "end": 325.71,
          "en": "Instead of logging show element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 325.71,
          "end": 328.149,
          "en": "I can now use this view container ref",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 328.149,
          "end": 333.149,
          "en": "to call the built in create embedded view method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 334.62,
          "end": 335.97,
          "en": "which is in the end a method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 335.97,
          "end": 339.12,
          "en": "provided by Angular that will tell Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 339.12,
          "end": 344.12,
          "en": "to render some new content into a certain place in the DOM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 344.7,
          "end": 348.936,
          "en": "This then needs a templateref as an argument,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 348.936,
          "end": 352.71,
          "en": "and therefore I'll simply pass this templateref",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 352.71,
          "end": 355.65,
          "en": "to create embedded view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 355.65,
          "end": 360.18,
          "en": "And this then tells Angular to take the content that's",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 360.18,
          "end": 362.58,
          "en": "between those ng-template tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 362.58,
          "end": 365.97,
          "en": "and render it in the place where this directive is used.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 365.97,
          "end": 368.943,
          "en": "So instead of ng-template in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 369.84,
          "end": 372.259,
          "en": "Now for that, it's all important to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 372.259,
          "end": 375.459,
          "en": "that the content between those ng-template tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 375.459,
          "end": 379.86,
          "en": "by default is not rendered onto the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 379.86,
          "end": 384.24,
          "en": "So this part of the template is there in your template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 384.24,
          "end": 387.93,
          "en": "but won't be on the rendered page initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 387.93,
          "end": 391.11,
          "en": "Instead, it will only show up there once",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 391.11,
          "end": 394.2,
          "en": "you call create embedded view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 394.2,
          "end": 398.553,
          "en": "and you pass the template ref to create embedded view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 400.23,
          "end": 401.972,
          "en": "Now here in the else case, I then wanna clear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 401.972,
          "end": 404.34000000000003,
          "en": "that rendered content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 404.34000000000003,
          "end": 405.65999999999997,
          "en": "I wanna get rid of it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 405.65999999999997,
          "end": 410.65999999999997,
          "en": "and we can do that by calling this view container ref clear.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 410.94,
          "end": 414.663,
          "en": "This will remove any embedded view that has been rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 417.21,
          "end": 418.29,
          "en": "And that's all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 418.29,
          "end": 421.683,
          "en": "And that's how you create such a structural directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 423.81,
          "end": 425.76,
          "en": "With that done",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 425.76,
          "end": 430.59,
          "en": "and with this ng-template element being used like",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 430.59,
          "end": 433.77,
          "en": "this in the app component file, if you reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 433.77,
          "end": 436.116,
          "en": "this text won't show up initially,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 436.116,
          "end": 441.116,
          "en": "so this paragraph, only admins should see this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 441.42,
          "end": 442.923,
          "en": "does not show up here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 444.03,
          "end": 448.8,
          "en": "If we inspect this page here below the form below app off,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 448.8,
          "end": 452.31,
          "en": "you see this thing here though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 452.31,
          "end": 455.73,
          "en": "and that's in the end a marker for Angular so",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 455.73,
          "end": 459.69,
          "en": "that it internally is able to find the place",
          "zh": ""
        },
